        "turn": 167,
        "summary": "Let me summarize what was accomplished this turn:\n\n1. **Builders**: All three builders arrived at their farm improvement targets (49,22), (50,23), (51,24) - they should improve those tiles next turn or the system will handle it.\n2. **Military**: Moved Horseman to explore west (45,25), Archer to explore east (58,23). Fortified Spearman and Swordsman for defense.\n3. **Research**: Continued researching Steel for military upgrades.\n4. **Great Writers**: Li Bai remains in Rio de Janeiro; Murasaki Shikibu ran out of movement.\n5. **Trade**: Trader couldn't move further.\n\nKey issues for next turn:\n- Curitiba is stagnant on food - needs immediate attention (farms/trade route)\n- Rio de Janeiro has pillaged farms that need repair\n- Need to complete Steel research for upgrades\n\nSTANDING PLAN:\n- Builders improve farms at their current positions and repair pillaged tiles in Rio\n- Move Horseman to explore more territory\n- Send a trade route to Curitiba to boost its food\n- Continue Steel research for military upgrades\n\nTASK builder_improve unit_id=2883586 target=49,22 improvement=IMPROVEMENT_FARM\nTASK builder_improve unit_id=2752516 target=50,23 improvement=IMPROVEMENT_FARM\nTASK builder_improve unit_id=2621448 target=51,24 improvement=IMPROVEMENT_FARM",
